    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:40fec0e7007e34a0",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "384a1fadb752e69302970cfc5f3b218f47dd63046e629d9242a231cbd0ec60cd",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Take a sightseeing tour of Lima with an English-speaking guide. See Miraflores and the Park of Love, view Huaca Huallamarca from the outside, and visit the main square and the Santo Domingo Convent. Visit Lima Cathedral or, if it is closed, the Lima Art Museum (MALI)."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:e899bf03e6e7298c",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7c13e89c621df6b7a13a4ec474ea0e6be26cbe310d98ce7c987f7bcd3bfe1ad4",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Explore Lima with an English-speaking guide. Start at the Park of Love in Miraflores for views of the Pacific Ocean, then pass Huaca Huallamarca, a pre-Inca administrative and religious center. Continue to the main square, where you'll see the Presidential Palace and City Hall. Visit Lima Cathedral or, if it is closed, the Lima Art Museum (MALI). Then walk to the Santo Domingo Convent along narrow streets once walked by Saint Martin de Porres and Saint Rose of Lima in the 17th century. Their remains rest in the city's cathedrals."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:c7c021ced1a79faf",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0d28ae9e71b868b43606b5eeab5d80b0e3b659160dd4ccc29d7744ca62114d10",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Colorful mosaic benches at the Park of Love overlooking the Miraflores coast in Lima, Peru"
    },
    {
